    "According to you, how can LLMs be used to innovate math learning in schools and universities?": "LLMs can offer personalized explanations, simplify complex topics, and provide step-by-step guidance. Students could ask questions in natural language and get clear, human-like responses. This could help those who struggle with traditional teaching. It’s not a replacement, but a tool to make math more accessible and less intimidating for learners."
